# Event Correlation & Sequence Detection
# -------------------------------------
# Purpose:
# Correlate security events over time to identify
# multi-step attack behaviour that is not visible
# from individual events alone.

# Step 1: Build Event Sequences
GROUP events BY entity WITHIN time_window

# Step 2: Analyse Sequences
FOR each event_sequence:
    IF sequence matches known attack pattern:
        generate correlated security alert
